  "evidencia": "Page: The Jargon Society. Sentence: Jargon has published seminal works of the American literary avant-garde, including books by Charles Olson, Louis Zukofsky, Paul Metcalf, James Broughton, and Williams himself, as well as \"sui generis\" books of folk art such as \"White Trash Cooking\".\nPage: Louis Zukofsky. Sentence: He was one of the founders and the primary theorist of the Objectivist group of poets and thus an important influence on subsequent generations of poets in America and abroad.",
